Status: starting Codex phase run.
**Phase 1 Status**

Implemented Phase 1 for vendor history selection and assessment validation. `flag-payment-request` now resolves to authority level 3 in [lib/authority/policy.js](/var/folders/vn/jrwn6x0579v_26grcpvwp_200000gn/T/e3d-pilot.impl-5802bc1f2fe4-repo-20260918061002.QtGpql/lib/authority/policy.js), and [lib/roles/riskAssess.js](/var/folders/vn/jrwn6x0579v_26grcpvwp_200000gn/T/e3d-pilot.impl-5802bc1f2fe4-repo-20260918061002.QtGpql/lib/roles/riskAssess.js) now exports only the Phase 1 pure helpers: vendor ID normalization, exact vendor-history selection, fenced-JSON parsing, and strict assessment normalization. Focused Phase 1 coverage was added in [test/riskAssess.test.js](/var/folders/vn/jrwn6x0579v_26grcpvwp_200000gn/T/e3d-pilot.impl-5802bc1f2fe4-repo-20260918061002.QtGpql/test/riskAssess.test.js).

**Verification**

`node --test test/riskAssess.test.js` passed. `npm install` completed. `npm run check` did not pass, but the failures are outside this phase: the suite is currently blocked by an existing missing sibling import for `e3d-trade/scripts/capitalMandates.js`, a missing `@smithy/core/retry` module during multiple CLI-path tests, and additional pre-existing integration/fixture failures that appear after those blockers.

The required handoff was written to [phase-1.md](/var/folders/vn/jrwn6x0579v_26grcpvwp_200000gn/T/e3d-pilot.impl-5802bc1f2fe4-repo-20260918061002.QtGpql/.codex-spec-runner/summaries/phase-1.md).
